# ========== UNITY DEFAULTS ==========
# Unity Editor
Library/
Temp/
Obj/
Build/
Builds/
Logs/
# NOTE: Packages/ is intentionally NOT ignored - Packages/manifest.json and
# Packages/packages-lock.json must be committed so the project resolves the same
# package set (incl. the Test Framework) on every machine.

